{"title":"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d52efc39e6ccbc32807b80af6dbac6d28a5bd8d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times (7 - 5) - 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/359a207486f0f0e49b31b7ec94ae51642b1662cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 11 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ -30 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 11 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"460\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/0/6c088d74619d27501969f3bc0f8a97ed04c41813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times (7 - 5) - 5 = 3 \\times 2 - 5 = 6 - 5 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"359\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mistakes\">Mistakes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Mistakes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> appears as both answer choices A and D.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal\">2007 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> 